{"id": 126892, "field": "description", "ja": "体をここに残したまま、あなたの魂はPandariaのPeak of Serenityへと飛ぶ。\n再びZen Pilgrimageを使うことで元の場所に戻る", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#3042"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
